# Normalize line endings to LF in the working tree on every platform. Windows CI
# runners default to core.autocrlf=true, which checks text files out as CRLF and
# breaks line-based parsers (e.g. SKILL.md frontmatter) and tests that compare
# against "\n". Forcing LF keeps the checkout byte-identical across platforms.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending normalized.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.gz binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.node binary
*.exe binary
*.dll binary
*.dylib binary
*.so binary
